,{"words":[{"surface":"பனிகால்","parts":[{"text":"பனி","lemma":"pani","gloss":"tears"},{"text":"கால்","lemma":"kāl","gloss":"shedding"}],"gloss":"shedding tears"},{"surface":"போழ்ந்து","parts":[{"text":"போழ்ந்து","lemma":"போழ்ந்து","gloss":"splitting"}],"gloss":"splitting","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"பணியெழில்","parts":[{"text":"பணி","lemma":"paṇi","gloss":"gentle"},{"text":"எழில்","lemma":"eḻil","gloss":"beauty"}],"gloss":"gentle beauty"},{"surface":"ஞெகிழ்தோள்","parts":[{"text":"ஞெகிழ்","lemma":"ñekiḻ","gloss":"to thin"},{"text":"தோள்","lemma":"tōḷ","gloss":"shoulder"}],"gloss":"thinning shoulders"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"மெல்லிய","parts":[{"text":"மெல்","lemma":"mel","gloss":"soft"},{"text":"இய","lemma":"iya","gloss":"appellative suffix"}],"gloss":"soft"},{"surface":"ஆகலின்","parts":[{"text":"ஆகல்","lemma":"ākal","gloss":"becoming"},{"text":"இன்","lemma":"iṉ","gloss":"because of"}],"gloss":"because they became"},{"surface":"மேவர","parts":[{"text":"மே","lemma":"mē","gloss":"desire"},{"text":"வர","lemma":"vara","gloss":"to come"}],"gloss":"desirably"},{"surface":"திரண்டு","parts":[{"text":"திரண்டு","lemma":"திரண்டு","gloss":"having rounded"}],"gloss":"having rounded","split_unverified":true}]},{"words":[{"surface":"நல்ல","parts":[{"text":"நல்","lemma":"nal","gloss":"good"},{"text":"அ","lemma":"a","gloss":"plural neuter suffix"}],"gloss":"good"},{"surface":"என்னும்","parts":[{"text":"என்","lemma":"eṉ","gloss":"to say"},{"text":"உம்","lemma":"um","gloss":"adjectival suffix"}],"gloss":"called"},{"surface":"சொல்லை","parts":[{"text":"சொல்","lemma":"col","gloss":"word"},{"text":"ஐ","lemma":"ai","gloss":"accusative"}],"gloss":"word"},{"surface":"மன்னிய","parts":[{"text":"மன்னு","lemma":"maṉṉu","gloss":"to endure"},{"text":"இய","lemma":"iya","gloss":"adjectival participle"}],"gloss":"enduring"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"ஏனலம்","parts":[{"text":"ஏனல்","lemma":"ēṉal","gloss":"millet field"},{"text":"அம்","lemma":"am","gloss":"euphonic increment"}],"gloss":"millet field"},{"surface":"சிறுதினை","parts":[{"text":"சிறு","lemma":"ciṟu","gloss":"small"},{"text":"தினை","lemma":"tiṉai","gloss":"millet"}],"gloss":"small millet"},{"surface":"காக்கும்","parts":[{"text":"கா","lemma":"kā","gloss":"to guard"},{"text":"க்கும்","lemma":"kkum","gloss":"habitual participle"}],"gloss":"guarding"},{"surface":"சேணோன்","parts":[{"text":"சேண்","lemma":"cēṇ","gloss":"high loft"},{"text":"ஓன்","lemma":"ōṉ","gloss":"he of"}],"gloss":"watchman on the loft"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"ஞெகிழியின்","parts":[{"text":"ஞெகிழி","lemma":"ñekiḻi","gloss":"firebrand"},{"text":"இன்","lemma":"iṉ","gloss":"from"}],"gloss":"from the firebrand"},{"surface":"பெயர்ந்த","parts":[{"text":"பெயர்ந்த","lemma":"பெயர்ந்த","gloss":"having retreated"}],"gloss":"having retreated","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"நெடுநல்","parts":[{"text":"நெடு","lemma":"neṭu","gloss":"tall"},{"text":"நல்","lemma":"nal","gloss":"fine"}],"gloss":"tall and fine"},{"surface":"யானை","parts":[{"text":"யானை","lemma":"yāṉai","gloss":"elephant"}],"gloss":"elephant"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"மின்படு","parts":[{"text":"மின்","lemma":"miṉ","gloss":"lightning"},{"text":"படு","lemma":"paṭu","gloss":"occurring"}],"gloss":"occurring lightning"},{"surface":"சுடரொளி","parts":[{"text":"சுடர்","lemma":"cuṭar","gloss":"bright"},{"text":"ஒளி","lemma":"oḷi","gloss":"light"}],"gloss":"bright light"},{"surface":"வெரூஉம்","parts":[{"text":"வெரூஉம்","lemma":"வெரூஉம்","gloss":"fears"}],"gloss":"fears","split_unverified":true}]},{"words":[{"surface":"வான்தோய்","parts":[{"text":"வான்","lemma":"vāṉ","gloss":"sky"},{"text":"தோய்","lemma":"tōy","gloss":"touching"}],"gloss":"sky-touching"},{"surface":"வெற்பன்","parts":[{"text":"வெற்பு","lemma":"veṟpu","gloss":"mountain"},{"text":"அன்","lemma":"aṉ","gloss":"lord of"}],"gloss":"lord of the mountains"},{"surface":"மணவா","parts":[{"text":"மண","lemma":"maṇa","gloss":"to marry"},{"text":"ஆ","lemma":"ā","gloss":"negative participle"}],"gloss":"before marrying"},{"surface":"ஊங்கே","parts":[{"text":"ஊங்கு","lemma":"ūṅku","gloss":"before"},{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ē","gloss":"emphasis"}],"gloss":"prior to"}]}],"literal":"Sorrow-afflicted, suffering, sleepless, kohl-dyed eyes / shedding tears, splitting, gentle beauty fading shoulders / soft because they were, desirably rounded / 'good' saying word, enduring / millet-field small millet guarding watchman on the loft / by the firebrand retreated tall fine elephant / lightning-occurring bright light fears / sky-touching mountain lord not marrying before","translation":"Before you marry her, O lord of the sky-touching mountains, where the tall, fine elephant that retreated from the watchman's firebrand in the small millet field now fears even the bright flash of lightning, her kohl-dyed eyes suffer from distressing grief and lose sleep, shedding tears, and her shoulders, once desirably rounded and soft, praised as beautiful, have now lost their gentle beauty and grown thin.","modern":"விண்ணைத் தொடும் மலைநாடனே! தினைப்புனத்தைக் காக்கும் பரண்மேல் உள்ள காவலன் வீசிய கொள்ளிக்கட்டைக்கு அஞ்சி ஓடிய பெரிய நல்ல யானையானது, வானில் தோன்றும் மின்னலின் ஒளியைக் கண்டும் அஞ்சும் நாட்டை உடையவனே! நீ அவளை மணந்து கொள்வதற்கு முன்னதாக, அவளுடைய மை தீட்டிய கண்கள் மிக்க துன்பத்தை உழந்து தூக்கமின்றிப் பனிநீரைச் சொரிகின்றன. மென்மையாக, விரும்பத்தக்க வகையில் திரண்டு 'நல்லவை' என்று பிறரால் புகழப்பட்ட அவளது தோள்கள், தம் அழகை இழந்து மெலிந்து போகின்றன.","explanation":"The friend speaks to the mountain lord, urging him to marry the heroine without further delay. She describes how the heroine's kohl-dyed eyes are sleepless and shedding tears, and her once-beautiful, rounded shoulders are wasting away due to the pain of separation. The poem is set in the Kuriñci landscape, characterized by the mountain lord's country. The friend uses a vivid metaphor: a great elephant, having once been scared by a watchman's firebrand in the millet field, now trembles even at a flash of lightning. Similarly, the heroine, having suffered the pain of temporary separations, is now terrified of any delay, fearing she might lose him forever. Key words like 'maṇavā ūṅkē' (before marrying) and 'veṟpaṉ' (lord of the mountains) emphasize the urgency of marriage.","model":"gemini-3.5-flash"},"timing":{"male":[[0.0,0.8],[0.8,1.2],[1.2,1.6],[1.6,2.0],[2.0,3.01],[3.01,3.4],[3.4,4.0],[4.0,4.6],[4.6,5.5],[5.5,5.7],[5.7,6.1],[6.1,6.5],[6.5,7.4],[7.4,7.8],[7.8,8.2],[8.2,8.4],[8.4,9.6],[9.6,10.0],[10.0,10.4],[10.4,10.8],[11.7,12.0],[12.0,12.4],[12.4,12.6],[12.6,13.2],[13.2,14.3],[14.3,14.8],[15.0,15.2],[15.2,16.2],[16.2,16.7],[16.7,16.9],[16.9,17.1]],"female":[[0.0,0.7],[0.7,1.1],[1.1,1.5],[1.5,1.9],[1.9,2.6],[2.6,2.97],[3.33,4.1],[4.22,4.7],[4.7,5.7],[5.7,6.0],[6.0,6.4],[6.4,6.8],[6.8,7.8],[7.8,8.2],[8.2,8.6],[8.6,8.9],[8.9,10.2],[10.2,10.6],[10.6,11.1],[11.1,11.5],[11.62,12.7],[12.7,13.2],[13.2,13.4],[13.4,14.1],[14.1,15.3],[15.3,15.8],[16.0,16.2],[16.2,17.0],[17.0,17.5],[17.5,17.8],[17.8,17.9]]}}